## Evidence

- Location: `{{evidence_path}}`; naming `{{evidence_naming}}`.
- Redact secrets, tokens and personal data in screenshots, logs and response bodies before saving.
- Link evidence from the results table; do not paste large logs into the report.

## Distribution

- Report written to `{{report_location}}`; results recorded in {{results_record}} by {{results_owner}}.
- Verdict handed to {{next_role}}.
- Posting outside the workspace ({{external_channels}}) only with the user's authorisation for that post.

